{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:f5a20452b5f9c5bf","name":"Ankarres Sapphire","source":{"id":"source:reference-f5a20452b5f9c5bf","title":"Ankarres Sapphire","revision":15835,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:53:17Z","sha256":"11b0036cea234ebd44b8e46d6f6799c3d13d3a9f4a7f84d6f89174a9b096c979","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=15835","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Ankarres%20Sapphire&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-f5a20452b5f9c5bf","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Color:"]}," Blue\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["DC Modifier:"]}," +5\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Ankarres Sapphire is a valuable gem that has passed through many hands over the years, including the hands of the bounty hunter ",{"tag":"a","children":["4-LOM"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/4-LOM","referenceId":"reference:f67a63f68cd546a5"}," around the time of the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yavin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yavin"},". Legend has it that the Ankarres Sapphire possesses incredible healing powers that, when used as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Crystal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Crystal"},", grants the wielder similar powers. Moreover, the legends say that only those who employ ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Light Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Light_Side"}," of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," can use the Ankarres Sapphire effectively.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you wield a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," attuned with the Ankarres Sapphire and you have a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," of 0, you gain a +5 Force bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," checks or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks made to activate the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Vital Transfer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vital_Transfer","referenceId":"reference:7a951a090c700baf"}]}," Force Power.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Ankarres Sapphire is thought to be unique, although it's possible that other such sapphires exist.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
